    "name": "Rhyolite",
    "steam_appid": 3195990,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195990/extras/d319384d234fc51b20dea713b9cba8e3.avif?t=1751590945\" width=620 height=189 /></span>Rhyolite is a  co-op action roguelite set on a steampunk locomotive being attacked by ghost trains. Defend, repair, and upgrade your train as you explore the railway with up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've blended ship vs. ship combat, challenging call-out chaos, and crew-based team dynamics together and poured it all into a cowboy boot-shaped mug!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195990/extras/1a197083975d88f7733605c29db325f2.poster.avif?t=1751590945\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195990/extras/1a197083975d88f7733605c29db325f2.webm?t=1751590945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195990/extras/1a197083975d88f7733605c29db325f2.mp4?t=1751590945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ASSEMBLE YOUR CREW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It takes a lot to keep a steam engine running. Choose your role \u2014 Engineer, Brakeman, Mechanic, Chemist, or Benefactor \u2014 and use your special skills to help your team stay on track.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE CHAOTIC COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think on your feet and adapt your strategy as the ghost train interferes by locking doors, swapping players, and generally creating mischief. Oh, and watch out for the giant wormhole!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEEP THE ENGINE RUNNING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your engine has seen better days, and these attacks from ghost mortars aren't helping. Repair broken systems, divert steam pressure, and prevent reactor meltdowns to keep your train chugging along \u2014 and do it fast, because these malfunctions escalate quickly. (We recommend welding that hole in the roof before the whole thing collapses.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADD BELLS AND WHISTLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose upgrades along your route, discover new specialty train cars, and reconfigure your train back at the rail yard in between runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BANISH THE GHOSTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run lets you explore more of the railway map, uncovering secrets as you go. How did these ghost trains come to be, and how can they be stopped? Only the most capable crews will find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195990/extras/040fe227e65321d338f5b808eda7ae61.avif?t=1751590945\" width=619 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack by Josie Brechner</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player mode,\u00a0with help from Frank the Automaton</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5+ unique character classes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer storyline with secret lore and multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5+ specialty car types and countless upgrade options </p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195990/extras/d319384d234fc51b20dea713b9cba8e3.avif?t=1751590945\" width=620 height=189 /></span>Rhyolite is a  co-op action roguelite set on a steampunk locomotive being attacked by ghost trains. Defend, repair, and upgrade your train as you explore the railway with up to 4 players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've blended ship vs. ship combat, challenging call-out chaos, and crew-based team dynamics together and poured it all into a cowboy boot-shaped mug!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195990/extras/1a197083975d88f7733605c29db325f2.poster.avif?t=1751590945\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195990/extras/1a197083975d88f7733605c29db325f2.webm?t=1751590945\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195990/extras/1a197083975d88f7733605c29db325f2.mp4?t=1751590945\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ASSEMBLE YOUR CREW</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It takes a lot to keep a steam engine running. Choose your role \u2014 Engineer, Brakeman, Mechanic, Chemist, or Benefactor \u2014 and use your special skills to help your team stay on track.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SURVIVE CHAOTIC COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think on your feet and adapt your strategy as the ghost train interferes by locking doors, swapping players, and generally creating mischief. Oh, and watch out for the giant wormhole!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEEP THE ENGINE RUNNING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your engine has seen better days, and these attacks from ghost mortars aren't helping. Repair broken systems, divert steam pressure, and prevent reactor meltdowns to keep your train chugging along \u2014 and do it fast, because these malfunctions escalate quickly. (We recommend welding that hole in the roof before the whole thing collapses.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ADD BELLS AND WHISTLES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose upgrades along your route, discover new specialty train cars, and reconfigure your train back at the rail yard in between runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BANISH THE GHOSTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run lets you explore more of the railway map, uncovering secrets as you go. How did these ghost trains come to be, and how can they be stopped? Only the most capable crews will find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3195990/extras/040fe227e65321d338f5b808eda7ae61.avif?t=1751590945\" width=619 height=200 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original soundtrack by Josie Brechner</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to 4 players online co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player mode,\u00a0with help from Frank the Automaton</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5+ unique character classes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer storyline with secret lore and multiple endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5+ specialty car types and countless upgrade options </p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Rhyolite is a co-op action roguelite for up to 4 players set on a steampunk locomotive being attacked by ghost trains. Defend, repair, and upgrade your train as you search the railway for a portal to the spirit world.",
